                                "sense_id": "7b512f49-953b-3af8-ade9-c2a40d056256",
                                "text": "A favorite Cape fast food is the gatsby, a large hot dog bun filled with cooked or processed meat, French fries, and sauce, or a salomi, curry wrapped in a roti flat bread."
